+| PM-KAFKA-ENTITY-CONNECT | aws-msk signal OUT→inherited IN+first OUT, empty initial definition/undeployed slot, repeated connect no new definition; SQL provenance/UUID and topology unchanged; no Kafka topic until explicit deploy |
