+
+Catalog environment/sourceEnvironmentId and import metadata are adjacent selection boundaries already present in develop; no whole PM catalog, freeze-history or unrelated engine coverage is added here. Imported Kafka slot rejection and context imported-slot behavior belong to the rows above. Actual GCP OAuth/managed BigQueue still require their separately authorized service/lifecycle prerequisites.
