+The current deployment method has36 physical variants (9 fields ×2 providers ×absent/null):32 concern fields with no intentional-null exception and4 concern legacy group-null conflict. The action method has10 variants (5 fields ×absent/null, current fixture MSK):6 concern unambiguous required metadata and4 concern pre-creation conflicts. These are preparation counts, not executed tests. No evaluated field is unconstrained/optional in SDK1.3.1. Action deployment_context and the three action display names are unconstrained/optional, but they are outside those five tested fields.
